==Trivia==
*[[We Dem Girlz]] is the only orgless team in this World Championship. Last time this occured was during the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/Season_3|Season 3 World Championship]] with [[The Leftovers]].
*This season brings back 21 players that participated in [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/Season_5|last season's World Championship]] in London.
*This is the first [[RLCS]] World Championship without a German player taking part.
*[[GarrettG]] and [[Fireburner]] to this day still have a 100% participation rate at an [[RLCS]] World Championship.
*13 nationalities will be represented at this season's World Championship. This ties the record of Season 3.
*This season's [[RLCS]] LAN marks the first appearance of 4 players in this event (specifically [[Fruity]], [[Yukeo]], [[Chicago]] & [[Shadey]]).
*This is [[NRG Esports]]' 5th appearance at a World Championship, which makes them the stand out leader within most appearances after being tied with [[Mock-It Esports]].
*[[Yukeo]] is the first Austrian player to take part at a World Championship.
*[[Kuxir97]] and [[Miztik]] return to a World Championship after 2 seasons of absence.
*[[Fruity]] is the first Danish player to play at a World Championship since Season 3.
*Canada and The Netherlands are being represented by the same players at this season's World Championship as in London during Season 5.
*This World Championship features 3 Keyboard/Mouse players: [[Yukeo]], [[Fruity]] & [[Torsos]].
*This is the first time [[Jake]] will not appear at LAN since Oceania began to participate in the World Championship.

